"text_sha256\":\"a13f7d23002b036937d0acdcdc8bcc5cce743b37083f8054a98e45d057a5fbde\"},\"name\":\"缺失情节\",\"number\":4,\"text\":\"**4｜缺失情节**  \\n补81-S1小争执：是否换医；81-S2病危后先备什么；81-S3死后第一轮谁料理、谁守、谁报信。只补过程，不加第二场危机。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5650,5794],\"lines\":[138,140],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"389c8ad25226231e7e1f32902e9727ed2a4baf79c2f398b381656e9e73bb66e5\"},\"name\":\"职业人物\",\"number\":10,\"text\":\"**10｜职业人物**  \\n大夫、药铺伙计只承担真实医药链；后事可有普通买棺/白布接口，但不要展开行业展示。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5794,6024],\"lines\":[141,143],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"c25ae2da466fd1bb06d1f27066219d885d8188bb098617b4905f0e88fd1cb22d\"},\"name\":\"人钱物信四链\",\"number\":11,\"text\":\"**11｜人钱物信四链**  \\n人：薛姨妈—宝钗—莺儿—医者。钱：仍属E0，薛家有钱但不是无限。物：药、米汤、甜羹、寿衣/白布、诗稿。信：病危先在内宅，死后再分头报人。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/1\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/1\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"ae707c1a2a525c1fccf88b6a7c7130ab223166b6f09ee54dc2f580ed665708d3\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S2\",\"title\":\"病危后的“先把什么备下”\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S2-R2\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"},{\"description\":\"病危消息先限于内宅；传话要有接话者与去向，莺儿接口未注册，不能写成已验证的全宅同时知情。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4957,5106],\"lines\":[123,125],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"2b9586da6ba1c5848634b2f92bcce0d00397aa3b91c2a227aef055688b317c4c\"},\"name\":\"缺失人物\",\"number\":5,\"text\":\"**5｜缺失人物**  \\n药铺跑腿、旧大夫/替换大夫可一闪而过；薛姨妈、宝钗、莺儿权责要清。不得新造“名医”。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5794,6024],\"lines\":[141,143],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"c25ae2da466fd1bb06d1f27066219d885d8188bb098617b4905f0e88fd1cb22d\"},\"name\":\"人钱物信四链\",\"number\":11,\"text\":\"**11｜人钱物信四链**  \\n人：薛姨妈—宝钗—莺儿—医者。钱：仍属E0，薛家有钱但不是无限。物：药、米汤、甜羹、寿衣/白布、诗稿。信：病危先在内宅，死后再分头报人。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/1\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/1\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"ae707c1a2a525c1fccf88b6a7c7130ab223166b6f09ee54dc2f580ed665708d3\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S2\",\"title\":\"病危后的“先把什么备下”\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S2-R3\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"},{\"description\":\"保留甜羹银匙与未完的淡青袖口在照护中的位置，普通家务继续；准备物件的沉默不得代替已记录的死亡时刻。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4390,4577],\"lines\":[114,116],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f0879c9ca2829acf13a4d6803a04c8a7ba938d4250c61c309de7be8b82b901b7\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最强处\",\"number\":2,\"text\":\"**2｜当前正文最强处**  \\n莺儿抢针线、甜羹银匙、淡青袖口未缝完；宝钗把旧诗稿夹入匣中；最终“并没人再念一遍”。这是本回最高P-Lock。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6024,6113],\"lines\":[144,146],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"15aa16c8737f925efc18b5cf931fa8df6c839e745041936244018df0589aad62\"},\"name\":\"必须保留\",\"number\":12,\"text\":\"**12｜必须保留**  \\n淡青袖口、银匙、甜羹、诗稿合匣、无人重读。\\n\\n\"},{\"ci