"equals\":\"character.xiangling.life_state\",\"reason\":\"即便有真实注册W81死亡事件，本场UNKNOWN入口不能重放为局部死亡出口；不以待写叙事自证状态。\",\"status\":\"PENDING\",\"value\":null},{\"basis\":[],\"equals\":\"character.baochai.household_role\",\"reason\":\"料理、收稿、报信的分配尚无职责或物件登记事件；只能作为待实现作者要求。\",\"status\":\"PENDING\",\"value\":null}],\"forbidden_beats\":[{\"description\":\"不得把香菱尸身写成仍能说话或作诗的在场人物；不能以章级W81事件推断精确死法、时刻或所有人同步知情。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4174,4390],\"lines\":[111,113],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"b6b8679c7fb2ec2253cea1f80a4236fa4276d15fe39299b90bb87bd6bc7c846d\"},\"name\":\"现有硬节点\",\"number\":1,\"text\":\"**1｜现有硬节点**  \\nR36“香魂返故乡”强约束；第80香菱已有血分亏损、干血病史，81只能承接，不得另造新病。当前死亡回次属C级施工，不把具体死法反升硬证。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4957,5106],\"lines\":[123,125],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"2b9586da6ba1c5848634b2f92bcce0d00397aa3b91c2a227aef055688b317c4c\"},\"name\":\"缺失人物\",\"number\":5,\"text\":\"**5｜缺失人物**  \\n药铺跑腿、旧大夫/替换大夫可一闪而过；薛姨妈、宝钗、莺儿权责要清。不得新造“名医”。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5794,6024],\"lines\":[141,143],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"c25ae2da466fd1bb06d1f27066219d885d8188bb098617b4905f0e88fd1cb22d\"},\"name\":\"人钱物信四链\",\"number\":11,\"text\":\"**11｜人钱物信四链**  \\n人：薛姨妈—宝钗—莺儿—医者。钱：仍属E0，薛家有钱但不是无限。物：药、米汤、甜羹、寿衣/白布、诗稿。信：病危先在内宅，死后再分头报人。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6547,6830],\"lines\":[162,165],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"4fc2d6eb3d26982bacc72a3385e0066eb197112b17d8b57d417640929e63e596\"},\"name\":\"最终章法 / 风险\",\"number\":18,\"text\":\"**18｜最终章法 / 风险**  \\n病日常 → 是否换医的小争执 → 短暂好转/饮食 → 病危 → 女眷处理身体 → 报信与后事 → 诗稿/袖口归置 → 无人再念。  \\n**风险：**把香菱写成第二黛玉；把“诗命”写成临终才华展览。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"66250193b895863e4771235b2189603178af9c07879a5aad75b9ffad234eff56\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S3-F1\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"},{\"description\":\"不得让全宅停止生活、把旧稿改成临终神作、重读诗稿或用作者诗说明诗成命尽。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5194,5400],\"lines\":[129,131],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"75205d4f3524473192ddf886335faa979e8db919fa738b8db63e3e1455ea152b\"},\"name\":\"诗文身份\",\"number\":7,\"text\":\"**7｜诗文身份**  \\nG02唯一开放：可在三张旧月诗之外夹一张**病前未成旧稿**，最多一两句；第45三案竞选。不得临终口占、绝命诗。作者回前/回末诗：无。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6113,6233],\"lines\":[147,149],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"44868fa023026893e476840b3e9d860421adf22f498b597e35b5512801855557\"},\"name\":\"应删/应降\",\"number\":13,\"text\":\"**13｜应删/应降**  \\n任何把香菱一生概括成“诗成而命尽”的作者说明；任何新咳血奇观。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6467,6547],\"lines\":[159,161],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"3850fe112671cba7c2411df7e6d44677ffe2b792011cd04fe0dfd4ae3e75bbdb\"},\"name\":\"回末诗\",\"number\":17,\"text\":\"**17｜回末诗**  \\n无；“没人再念一遍”必须胜过作者挽诗。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"66250193b895863e4771235b2189603178af9c07879a5aad75b9ffad234eff56\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S3-F2\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"}],\"function\":\"把章级死亡之后的第一轮料理身体、守候、报信和费用授权分开，使旧诗稿与袖口的归置落在家务中，最终无人重读而不另作挽诗。\",\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"kind\":\"AGENT_SCENE_CONTRACT\",\"knowledge_binding\":null,\"knowledge_event_refs\":[],\"notes\":\"81—85编辑从本场实际v1深拷贝新建v2，status=AGENT_EDITED只表示已作编辑，不表示语义支持、独立阅读、证据或权威；authority_effect=NONE、evidence_effect=NONE。原v1字节不变。本次逐项改动：81-S3-R1：死亡作为本场叙事前提必须由正文交代，不在料理场重演一次死亡；区分薛姨妈的授权与宝钗的实际料理，为谁守、谁报信交代接手与去向。香菱只作被料理的身体和旧物所指，不增列能行动的参与者；消息仍逐一传到，不靠旁白一笔包办。；81-S3-R3：让宝钗把已有三张旧月诗稿收拢入匣，淡青袖口与未完针线仍属可收拾之物；可选夹入一张病前未成旧稿，但须先核其文本与选择，最多一两句，不是临终新作。这里的夹入或辨认不构成死后朗读、追悼重读；旧稿未选定便不新增具体诗句。。后场前驱如有只改指同一编辑选集v2，显式顺序仍非核实年代且不继承状态。参与者KNOWN只指已绑定注册主体子集，不证明现场同在或涵盖未注册接口；所有原状态值、UNKNOWN/PENDING、basis、知识绑定、事件关联及对象ID不变。章卡要求不作历史状态依据；不借86知识场景或药碗补本场缺口。模型同侪阅读与正文语义验证仍待进行，不声明任何语义PASS。\",\"object_transition_refs\":[],\"order\":3,\"participants\":[\"xue_yima\",\"baochai\"],\"participants_status\":\"KNOWN\",\"preconditions\":[{\"basis\":[],\"equals\":\"character.xiangling.body_state\",\"reason\":\"处理身体须在死亡之后；仅有章级死亡后身体状态，场间顺序及尸身处置记录尚不受支持。\",\"status\":\"PENDING\",\"value\":null}],\"references\":{\"knowledge\":[],\"objects\":[],\"participants\":[{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_core.json\",\"pointer\":\"/characters/26\",\"ref\":\"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/26\",\"sha256\":\"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733\",\"text_sha256\":\"26f65be472892755beebd1cf953ca0f7c7b048431c54ce82d5eff8da83bd880b\",\"value\":{\"baseline\":{\"body_state\":\"ordinary\",\"household_role\":\"xue_matriarch\",\"legal_status\":\"NOT_AT_ISSUE\",\"life_state\":\"ACTIVE\",\"location\":\"S02\",\"marital_status\":\"WIDOWED\"},\"groups\":[\"xue_household\",\"human\"],\"id\":\"xue_yima\",\"name\":\"薛姨妈\"}},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_core.json\",\"pointer\":\"/characters/1\",\"ref\":\"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/1\",\"sha256\":\"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733\",\"text_sha256\":\"539bb81553f85ece6e29214a008c499290b50068e2127c17a80cc113c82ae6b5\",\"value\":{\"baseline\":{\"body_state\":\"ordinary\",\"household_role\":\"xue_daughter_guest\",\"legal_status\":\"NOT_AT_ISSUE\",\"life_state\":\"ACTIVE\",\"location\":\"S02\",\"marital_status\":\"UNMARRIED\"},\"groups\":[\"jia_household\",\"xue_household\",\"human\"],\"id\":\"baochai\",\"name\":\"薛宝钗\"}},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_core.json\",\"pointer\":\"/characters/3\",\"ref\":\"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/3\",\"sha256\":\"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733\",\"text_sha256\":\"258762fbcedf06308334686b9af172f3c4616dbd82c070d37c77576c914d6f57\",\"value\":{\"baseline\":{\"body_state\":\"terminal_chronic\",\"household_role\":\"xue_household_concubine\",\"legal_status\":\"NOT_AT_ISSUE\",\"life_state\":\"ACTIVE\",\"location\":\"S01\",\"marital_status\":\"CONCUBINE_OF_XUEPAN\"},\"groups\":[\"xue_household\",\"human\"],\"id\":\"xiangling\",\"name\":\"香菱\"}}]},\"required_beats\":[{\"description\":\"死亡作为本场叙事前提必须由正文交代，不在料理场重演一次死亡；区分薛姨妈的授权与宝钗的实际料理，为谁守、谁报信交代接手与去向。香菱只作被料理的身体和旧物所指，不增列能行动的参与者；消息仍逐一传到，不靠旁白一笔包办。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4577,4776],\"lines\":[117,119],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"27c6a142b564a9acd734196fe15be392177c7e2290430abc7d111cc668fbe3a5\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最薄处\",\"number\":3,\"text\":\"**3｜当前正文最薄处**  \\n病程从“已经坏下去”到死亡的家庭判断过程仍略快；谁决定换不换医生、谁开始预备后事、薛家如何分担费用可再实一层。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4776,4957],\"lines\":[120,122],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"a13f7d23002b036937d0acdcdc8bcc5cce743b37083f8054a98e45d057a5fbde\"},\"name\":\"缺失情节\",\"number\":4,\"text\":\"**4｜缺失情节**  \\n补81-S1小争执：是否换医；81-S2病危后先备什么；81-S3死后第一轮谁料理、谁守、谁报信。只补过程，不加第二场危机。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4957,5106],\"lines\":[123,125],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"2b9586da6ba1c5848634b2f92bcce0d00397aa3b91c2a227aef055688b317c4c\"},\"name\":\"缺失人物\",\"number\":5,\"text\":\"**5｜缺失人物**  \\n药铺跑腿、旧大夫/替换大夫可一闪而过；薛姨妈、宝钗、莺儿权责要清。不得新造“名医”。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6547,6830],\"lines\":[162,165],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"4fc2d6eb3d26982bacc72a3385e0066eb197112b17d8b57d417640929e63e596\"},\"name\":\"最终章法 / 风险\",\"number\":18,\"text\":\"**18｜最终章法 / 风险**  \\n病日常 → 是否换医的小争执 → 短暂好转/饮食 → 病危 → 女眷处理身体 → 报信与后事 → 诗稿/袖口归置 → 无人再念。  \\n**风险：**把香菱写成第二黛玉；把“诗命”写成临终才华展览。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"66250193b895863e4771235b2189603178af9c07879a5aad75b9ffad234eff56\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S3-R1\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"},{\"description\":\"普通买棺、白布和身体整理接口只写必要经手与薛家开支，不开展殡葬行业展示；外部跑腿未注册，待写的分工不算已发生交易。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5650,5794],\"lines\":[138,140],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"389c8ad25226231e7e1f32902e9727ed2a4baf79c2f398b381656e9e73bb66e5\"},\"name\":\"职业人物\",\"number\":10,\"text\":\"**10｜职业人物**  \\n大夫、药铺伙计只承担真实医药链；后事可有普通买棺/白布接口，但不要展开行业展示。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5794,6024],\"lines\":[141,143],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"c25ae2da466fd1bb06d1f27066219d885d8188bb098617b4905f0e88fd1cb22d\"},\"name\":\"人钱物信四链\",\"number\":11,\"text\":\"**11｜人钱物信四链**  \\n人：薛姨妈—宝钗—莺儿—医者。钱：仍属E0，薛家有钱但不是无限。物：药、米汤、甜羹、寿衣/白布、诗稿。信：病危先在内宅，死后再分头报人。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"66250193b895863e4771235b2189603178af9c07879a5aad75b9ffad234eff56\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S3-R2\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"},{\"description\":\"让宝钗把已有三张旧月诗稿收拢入匣，淡青袖口与未完针线仍属可收拾之物；可选夹入一张病前未成旧稿，但须先核其文本与选择，最多一两句，不是临终新作。这里的夹入或辨认不构成死后朗读、追悼重读；旧稿未选定便不新增具体诗句。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4390,4577],\"lines\":[114,116],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f0879c9ca2829acf13a4d6803a04c8a7ba938d4250c61c309de7be8b82b901b7\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最强处\",\"number\":2,\"text\":\"**2｜当前正文最强处**  \\n莺儿抢针线、甜羹银匙、淡青袖口未缝完；宝钗把旧诗稿夹入匣中；最终“并没人再念一遍”。这是本回最高P-Lock。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5194,5400],\"lines\":[129,131],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"75205d4f3524473192ddf886335faa979e8db919fa738b8db63e3e1455ea152b\"},\"name\":\"诗文身份\",\"number\":7,\"text\":\"**7｜诗文身份**  \\nG02唯一开放：可在三张旧月诗之外夹一张**病前未成旧稿**，最多一两句；第45三案竞选。不得临终口占、绝命诗。作者回前/回末诗：无。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6024,6113],\"lines\":[144,146],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"15aa16c8737f925efc18b5cf931fa8df6c839e745041936244018df0589aad62\"},\"name\":\"必须保留\",\"number\":12,\"text\":\"**12｜必须保留**  \\n淡青袖口、银匙、甜羹、诗稿合匣、无人重读。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"66250193b895863e4771235b2189603178af9c07879a5aad75b9ffad234eff56\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S3-R3\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"},{\"description\":\"报信、家务、归置依次继续，收匣以后不安排再读一遍的追悼表演，让没人再念承担结尾而非作者挽诗。\",\"grounding\":{\"chapter_card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4390,4577],\"lines\":[114,116],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f0879c9ca2829acf13a4d6803a04c8a7ba938d4250c61c309de7be8b82b901b7\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最强处\",\"number\":2,\"text\":\"**2｜当前正文最强处**  \\n莺儿抢针线、甜羹银匙、淡青袖口未缝完；宝钗把旧诗稿夹入匣中；最终“并没人再念一遍”。这是本回最高P-Lock。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6024,6113],\"lines\":[144,146],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"15aa16c8737f925efc18b5cf931fa8df6c839e745041936244018df0589aad62\"},\"name\":\"必须保留\",\"number\":12,\"text\":\"**12｜必须保留**  \\n淡青袖口、银匙、甜羹、诗稿合匣、无人重读。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6467,6547],\"lines\":[159,161],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"3850fe112671cba7c2411df7e6d44677ffe2b792011cd04fe0dfd4ae3e75bbdb\"},\"name\":\"回末诗\",\"number\":17,\"text\":\"**17｜回末诗**  \\n无；“没人再念一遍”必须胜过作者挽诗。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6547,6830],\"lines\":[162,165],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"4fc2d6eb3d26982bacc72a3385e0066eb197112b17d8b57d417640929e63e596\"},\"name\":\"最终章法 / 风险\",\"number\":18,\"text\":\"**18｜最终章法 / 风险**  \\n病日常 → 是否换医的小争执 → 短暂好转/饮食 → 病危 → 女眷处理身体 → 报信与后事 → 诗稿/袖口归置 → 无人再念。  \\n**风险：**把香菱写成第二黛玉；把“诗命”写成临终才华展览。\\n\\n\"}],\"seed\":{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0/candidate_scenes/2\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"66250193b895863e4771235b2189603178af9c07879a5aad75b9ffad234eff56\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}}},\"id\":\"81-S3-R4\",\"scope\":\"AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT\",\"status\":\"PENDING\"}],\"required_objects\":[],\"revision\":\"v2\",\"schema_version\":1,\"status\":\"AGENT_EDITED\",\"unresolved\":[\"model_peer_readings_pending: 已由81—85编辑核对实际v1、绑定章卡/种子及世界边界；编辑不计独立读者，模型同侪阅读尚待进行，正文语义未验。\",\"declared_sequence_only: 依候选列表显式声明前驱；历史场景顺序和与既有正文的精确放置未核验。\",\"scene_local_checkpoint: 后场入口UNKNOWN；前一覆盖文件只是显式顺序，不产生或继承局部状态快照。\",\"unregistered_participants: 莺儿、守候和报信经手人没有注册ID；香菱只列为叙述对象，不虚列为能行动的在场人物。\",\"unregistered_objects: 诗稿、匣、淡青袖口、寿衣、白布、棺及费用记录无对象ID或转移事件，收稿不能宣称物态重放成功。\",\"event_localization: W81-XIANGLING-DEATH为同章注册前缀，仅绑定章级关联；不是81-S3的可执行入口或精确死亡时点。\",\"knowledge_registry_gap: 死讯、报信去向与收受者知情没有注册事实或知识场景；无人重读仍需独立语义审查。\",\"old_draft_selection_pending: 章卡允许的病前未成旧稿尚未选定文本，不在死后收匣场新增朗读或具体诗句。\"]}],\"chapter\":81,\"chapter_plan\":{\"authority_effect\":\"NONE\",\"card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4174,4390],\"lines\":[111,113],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"b6b8679c7fb2ec2253cea1f80a4236fa4276d15fe39299b90bb87bd6bc7c846d\"},\"name\":\"现有硬节点\",\"number\":1,\"text\":\"**1｜现有硬节点**  \\nR36“香魂返故乡”强约束；第80香菱已有血分亏损、干血病史，81只能承接，不得另造新病。当前死亡回次属C级施工，不把具体死法反升硬证。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4390,4577],\"lines\":[114,116],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f0879c9ca2829acf13a4d6803a04c8a7ba938d4250c61c309de7be8b82b901b7\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最强处\",\"number\":2,\"text\":\"**2｜当前正文最强处**  \\n莺儿抢针线、甜羹银匙、淡青袖口未缝完；宝钗把旧诗稿夹入匣中；最终“并没人再念一遍”。这是本回最高P-Lock。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4577,4776],\"lines\":[117,119],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"27c6a142b564a9acd734196fe15be392177c7e2290430abc7d111cc668fbe3a5\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最薄处\",\"number\":3,\"text\":\"**3｜当前正文最薄处**  \\n病程从“已经坏下去”到死亡的家庭判断过程仍略快；谁决定换不换医生、谁开始预备后事、薛家如何分担费用可再实一层。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4776,4957],\"lines\":[120,122],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"a13f7d23002b036937d0acdcdc8bcc5cce743b37083f8054a98e45d057a5fbde\"},\"name\":\"缺失情节\",\"number\":4,\"text\":\"**4｜缺失情节**  \\n补81-S1小争执：是否换医；81-S2病危后先备什么；81-S3死后第一轮谁料理、谁守、谁报信。只补过程，不加第二场危机。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4957,5106],\"lines\":[123,125],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"2b9586da6ba1c5848634b2f92bcce0d00397aa3b91c2a227aef055688b317c4c\"},\"name\":\"缺失人物\",\"number\":5,\"text\":\"**5｜缺失人物**  \\n药铺跑腿、旧大夫/替换大夫可一闪而过；薛姨妈、宝钗、莺儿权责要清。不得新造“名医”。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5106,5194],\"lines\":[126,128],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"e714852c80abf0969e357bcb0571759ada6cada4611dd65fec130f7a928682cc\"},\"name\":\"缺失文化门类\",\"number\":6,\"text\":\"**6｜缺失文化门类**  \\n不补琴棋书画。香菱唯一文化主轴是诗稿。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5194,5400],\"lines\":[129,131],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"75205d4f3524473192ddf886335faa979e8db919fa738b8db63e3e1455ea152b\"},\"name\":\"诗文身份\",\"number\":7,\"text\":\"**7｜诗文身份**  \\nG02唯一开放：可在三张旧月诗之外夹一张**病前未成旧稿**，最多一两句；第45三案竞选。不得临终口占、绝命诗。作者回前/回末诗：无。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5400,5534],\"lines\":[132,134],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"abc7114b6235f49d80259c7b5007dbf662d5e06f1b0d7335b4f7f496d7e48e8c\"},\"name\":\"笑料/俗文化\",\"number\":8,\"text\":\"**8｜笑料/俗文化**  \\n保留“药苦是不是莺儿煎久了”等轻口角，让病回仍有人味；不新增临终笑料。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5534,5650],\"lines\":[135,137],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"589fddb1c50bf47a5f899b6e0e855604ad48847f520f0b4c908fc81fe81741c4\"},\"name\":\"梦/宗教\",\"number\":9,\"text\":\"**9｜梦/宗教**  \\n低强度。人物可说“命苦”等俗语，不做香菱梦归故乡、托梦、悟道。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5650,5794],\"lines\":[138,140],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"389c8ad25226231e7e1f32902e9727ed2a4baf79c2f398b381656e9e73bb66e5\"},\"name\":\"职业人物\",\"number\":10,\"text\":\"**10｜职业人物**  \\n大夫、药铺伙计只承担真实医药链；后事可有普通买棺/白布接口，但不要展开行业展示。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5794,6024],\"lines\":[141,143],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"c25ae2da466fd1bb06d1f27066219d885d8188bb098617b4905f0e88fd1cb22d\"},\"name\":\"人钱物信四链\",\"number\":11,\"text\":\"**11｜人钱物信四链**  \\n人：薛姨妈—宝钗—莺儿—医者。钱：仍属E0，薛家有钱但不是无限。物：药、米汤、甜羹、寿衣/白布、诗稿。信：病危先在内宅，死后再分头报人。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6024,6113],\"lines\":[144,146],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"15aa16c8737f925efc18b5cf931fa8df6c839e745041936244018df0589aad62\"},\"name\":\"必须保留\",\"number\":12,\"text\":\"**12｜必须保留**  \\n淡青袖口、银匙、甜羹、诗稿合匣、无人重读。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6113,6233],\"lines\":[147,149],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"44868fa023026893e476840b3e9d860421adf22f498b597e35b5512801855557\"},\"name\":\"应删/应降\",\"number\":13,\"text\":\"**13｜应删/应降**  \\n任何把香菱一生概括成“诗成而命尽”的作者说明；任何新咳血奇观。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6233,6272],\"lines\":[150,152],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f139bd53eab5c715ba42c69c45afb23b68241f0f05ce11a5075a301f8b5cb4d2\"},\"name\":\"L3候选\",\"number\":14,\"text\":\"**14｜L3候选**  \\n无。最高L2。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6272,6438],\"lines\":[153,155],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f27e6fc231316cf9ef8b8d71fcc7ed74cff0c73ecaa5829600f71745f936d734\"},\"name\":\"前80同构\",\"number\":15,\"text\":\"**15｜前80同构**  \\n48—49香菱学诗的“用力、改稿、梦中得句”与本回旧稿形成回声；63“死金丹”提示死亡回仍可并存家务。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6438,6467],\"lines\":[156,158],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"62839ce573b6e44b7587da02b72bc758ff77474e45becd4e4e057625041775cd\"},\"name\":\"回前诗\",\"number\":16,\"text\":\"**16｜回前诗**  \\n无。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6467,6547],\"lines\":[159,161],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"3850fe112671cba7c2411df7e6d44677ffe2b792011cd04fe0dfd4ae3e75bbdb\"},\"name\":\"回末诗\",\"number\":17,\"text\":\"**17｜回末诗**  \\n无；“没人再念一遍”必须胜过作者挽诗。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6547,6830],\"lines\":[162,165],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"4fc2d6eb3d26982bacc72a3385e0066eb197112b17d8b57d417640929e63e596\"},\"name\":\"最终章法 / 风险\",\"number\":18,\"text\":\"**18｜最终章法 / 风险**  \\n病日常 → 是否换医的小争执 → 短暂好转/饮食 → 病危 → 女眷处理身体 → 报信与后事 → 诗稿/袖口归置 → 无人再念。  \\n**风险：**把香菱写成第二黛玉；把“诗命”写成临终才华展览。\\n\\n\"}],\"chapter\":81,\"entry_ref\":null,\"evidence_effect\":\"NONE\",\"existing_contracts\":[],\"exit_ref\":null,\"open_refs\":[],\"order_basis\":\"SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY\",\"protections\":[\"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_protections/0\"],\"scenes\":[{\"id\":\"81-S1\",\"order\":1,\"ref\":\"data/planning/scenes/81-S1.json\"},{\"id\":\"81-S2\",\"order\":2,\"ref\":\"data/planning/scenes/81-S2.json\"},{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"order\":3,\"ref\":\"data/planning/scenes/81-S3.json\"}],\"source\":{\"byte_range\":[4054,6835],\"lines\":[106,167],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"fbd00bbe7949123cb3f7304182d15913f176f2f933f44f891f6faf8f021420ba\"},\"source_records\":[{\"path\":\"data/reconstruction/m2.json\",\"pointer\":\"/chapters/0\",\"ref\":\"data/reconstruction/m2.json#/chapters/0\",\"sha256\":\"345b9572314ef414c1b4b4892126a57a89b335bdb0a756fa9d2e89a909d6939f\",\"text_sha256\":\"53ec029f504abefdc43900a49f65f4995702b90c4643665990da377c2fe8f17b\",\"value\":{\"anchor_refs\":[\"R36\"],\"chapter\":81,\"field_schema_ref\":\"chapter-card-18-fields-v2.5\",\"key_constraints\":[\"香菱病势直接承接80回，不另造新病\",\"淡青未完袖、银匙、甜汤等生活物件保留\",\"诗稿收箱但无人重读，不造绝命诗\"],\"pressure_test\":false,\"semantic_coverage\":\"PARTIAL_STRUCTURED\",\"source_lines\":[106,167],\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"title\":\"薄命女沉疴香魂逝　蘅芜君收存旧诗稿\",\"title_status\":\"TG_WORKING\"}},{\"path\":\"data/reconstruction/m2.json\",\"pointer\":\"/timeline/0\",\"ref\":\"data/reconstruction/m2.json#/timeline/0\",\"sha256\":\"345b9572314ef414c1b4b4892126a57a89b335bdb0a756fa9d2e89a909d6939f\",\"text_sha256\":\"7262045df5cb6b523bb4f15c3469b3a66021a232496709eadcf9185296f1e7a5\",\"value\":{\"chapter\":81,\"epistemic\":\"RUN_LOCK_NOT_ORIGINAL_DATING\",\"lock_level\":\"RUN-CURRENT(C)\",\"required_relation\":\"香菱的病必须从80回直接延续，不能像续书重新开局\",\"source_line\":72,\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:b27e9229499cbe39f4c9339d6186fe6db113d0e7d48f3ae6b0071e1b1ca88f41\",\"time_window\":\"紧接80回\"}},{\"path\":\"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json\",\"pointer\":\"/chapter_plans/0\",\"ref\":\"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_plans/0\",\"sha256\":\"f9ba473eb93d8639d2cc9639aa67a698010cee8d1da20b05ebf81eb897bf0fe1\",\"text_sha256\":\"139f0f13de957073d263165c74f2edd86f77015f6b331cbffb27853c87e2e995\",\"value\":{\"chapter\":81,\"edit_level\":\"L2\",\"hard_boundary\":\"香菱死亡回次属C施工；承接第80病线，不另造新病。\",\"must_keep\":\"淡青袖口、银匙、甜羹、诗稿合匣、无人重读。\",\"plan_class\":\"B级补桥\",\"risk\":\"把香菱写成第二黛玉；把诗命写成临终才华展览。\",\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"title_source\":\"TG工作回目\"}},{\"path\":\"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json\",\"pointer\":\"/chapter_protections/0\",\"ref\":\"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_protections/0\",\"sha256\":\"f9ba473eb93d8639d2cc9639aa67a698010cee8d1da20b05ebf81eb897bf0fe1\",\"text_sha256\":\"b6b76978033bd2ca4cdb880192384f1dccc3560f048d0da396060cb4e4557670\",\"value\":{\"allowed_additions\":\"医疗/烧埋/诗命形成过程\",\"chapter\":81,\"forbidden_drift\":\"不让全宅停止生活；不把旧稿改成临终神作\",\"level\":\"P2\",\"must_preserve\":\"病势转重时甜羹/银匙说嘴；淡青袖口；诗稿合匣后没人再念\",\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:626917a3603d00697ccb86e6be8d1bb5b40911ffad700436ea836cd8e6336261\"}},{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/gap_cards/0\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/gap_cards/0\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"e1cf5fc4ec3db5ef791548d9a25a1e8ceb3bc7a585a7bab72d7a50b12d806203\",\"value\":{\"chapter\":81,\"priority\":\"第二批\",\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:faae6f996071b532940ceddfdd55830df7eb60a59d98ee167f725dffd7b4f3d0\",\"source_symbols\":{\"arts\":\"△\",\"body\":\"△\",\"chapter_frame\":\"△\",\"comic_folk\":\"✓\",\"dream_symbol\":\"✓\",\"economy\":\"△\",\"main_process\":\"△\",\"metaphysics\":\"—\",\"minor_agents\":\"✓\",\"poetry\":\"▲\",\"ritual\":\"△\",\"secondary_plot\":\"✓\"},\"states\":{\"arts\":\"THIN\",\"body\":\"THIN\",\"chapter_frame\":\"THIN\",\"comic_folk\":\"SUFFICIENT\",\"dream_symbol\":\"SUFFICIENT\",\"economy\":\"THIN\",\"main_process\":\"THIN\",\"metaphysics\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\",\"minor_agents\":\"SUFFICIENT\",\"poetry\":\"MISSING\",\"ritual\":\"THIN\",\"secondary_plot\":\"SUFFICIENT\"}}},{\"path\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json\",\"pointer\":\"/omitted_scene_plans/0\",\"ref\":\"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/0\",\"sha256\":\"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff\",\"text_sha256\":\"ac1baa2da44e14afc2e640daa685625a7aaea3950e6f03c6f07f8290d803a4b9\",\"value\":{\"action\":\"加厚\",\"candidate_scenes\":[{\"id\":\"81-S1\",\"title\":\"“这回是不是该换大夫”的小争执\"},{\"id\":\"81-S2\",\"title\":\"病危后的“先把什么备下”\"},{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"title\":\"死亡后的第一轮权力分配\"}],\"chapter\":81,\"core_process\":\"慢病→危急→死亡→薛家后事分工\",\"handoff\":\"39医学礼俗、37诗文\",\"intensity\":\"中\",\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:4e1dd2a2d7669011ece72f8d7a5b93903b235042aadd528f0178f6544901dc7b\"}},{\"path\":\"data/literary_ecology/m5.json\",\"pointer\":\"/author_rhyme_chapters/0\",\"ref\":\"data/literary_ecology/m5.json#/author_rhyme_chapters/0\",\"sha256\":\"9fbc4013d0c42c957516af85e726180441ed54548d0ec4366f832fdd9f5696e4\",\"text_sha256\":\"b8be22ccbfdef38bd5eb34617f03a43e3c69b083bfc040c372c7061e1bafd594\",\"value\":{\"chapter\":81,\"ending_anchor\":\"诗稿夹匣，并没人再念一遍\",\"mode\":\"散文收\",\"source_ref\":\"asset:sha256:fc421b406baee7946b3d3bf4291c59678bfb09a04d13939c9e80199f157e7674\",\"winner\":\"C\"}}],\"status\":\"DRAFT_IMPORTED\",\"threads\":[],\"title\":\"薄命女沉疴香魂逝　蘅芜君收存旧诗稿\",\"title_status\":\"TG工作回目\",\"unresolved\":[\"entry_ref\",\"exit_ref\",\"threads\",\"open_refs\",\"scene_chronology\",\"existing_contract_placement\"]},\"exemplar_dataset_ref\":\"corpus:front80:v2-candidate\",\"exemplars\":[{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf\",\"chapter\":27,\"classification\":{\"human_review\":\"PENDING\",\"method\":\"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2\",\"reasons\":[\"DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR\"],\"styles\":[{\"color\":2301728,\"font\":\"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H\",\"size\":15.58}]},\"dataset_ref\":\"corpus:front80:v2-candidate\",\"kind\":\"MAIN_TEXT\",\"locator\":{\"extraction_ref\":\"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900\",\"spans\":[{\"end\":568,\"start\":516,\"unit_ref\":\"pdf:page:393\"}],\"transforms\":[]},\"record_type\":\"SEGMENT\",\"section_ref\":\"chapter:27\",\"segment_id\":\"hlm80:chapter:27:p00128\",\"selection_reason\":\"第27回小红回凤姐话：观察丫鬟传话时的多层称谓与回话。\",\"text\":\"红玉道：“平姐姐说：我们奶奶问这里奶奶\\n好。原是我们二爷不在家，虽然迟了两天，只管请奶奶放心。\\n等五奶奶\",\"text_sha256\":\"bb37f7c183903e29f1ca30ab22c782708924b29b9c782620ec07536238c09150\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf\",\"chapter\":24,\"classification\":{\"human_review\":\"PENDING\",\"method\":\"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2\",\"reasons\":[\"DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR\"],\"styles\":[{\"color\":2301728,\"font\":\"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H\",\"size\":15.58}]},\"dataset_ref\":\"corpus:front80:v2-candidate\",\"kind\":\"MAIN_TEXT\",\"locator\":{\"extraction_ref\":\"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900\",\"spans\":[{\"end\":762,\"start\":659,\"unit_ref\":\"pdf:page:344\"}],\"transforms\":[]},\"record_type\":\"SEGMENT\",\"section_ref\":\"chapter:24\",\"segment_id\":\"hlm80:chapter:24:p00066\",\"selection_reason\":\"第24回贾芸求舅舅赊货：观察差事、银钱与人物声口。\",\"text\":\"原来卜世仁现开香料铺，方才从铺子里来，忽\\n见贾芸进来，彼此见过了，因问他这早晚什么事跑了来。贾芸\\n道：“有件事求舅舅帮衬帮衬。我有一件事，用些冰片麝香使\\n用，好歹舅舅每样赊四两给我，八月里按数送了银子来。”\",\"text_sha256\":\"add8d8d7a9b14836a9ea90a162eccde4752ba78fd1221c9006060b667c18166a\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf\",\"chapter\":74,\"classification\":{\"human_review\":\"PENDING\",\"method\":\"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2\",\"reasons\":[\"DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR\"],\"styles\":[{\"color\":2301728,\"font\":\"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H\",\"size\":15.58}]},\"dataset_ref\":\"corpus:front80:v2-candidate\",\"kind\":\"MAIN_TEXT\",\"locator\":{\"extraction_ref\":\"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900\",\"spans\":[{\"end\":493,\"start\":63,\"unit_ref\":\"pdf:page:1013\"}],\"transforms\":[]},\"record_type\":\"SEGMENT\",\"section_ref\":\"chapter:74\",\"segment_id\":\"hlm80:chapter:74:p00079\",\"selection_reason\":\"第74回抄检：观察同一事件中的身份与群像差异。\",\"text\":\"遂命众丫\\n鬟秉烛开门而待。一时，众人来了。探春故问何事。凤姐笑道：\\n“因丢了一件东西，连日访察不出人来，恐怕旁人赖这些女孩\\n子们，所以越性大家搜一搜，使人去疑，倒是洗净他们的好法\\n子。”探春冷笑道：“我们的丫头自然都是些贼，我就是头一\\n个窝主。既如此，先来搜我的箱柜，他们所有偷了来的都交给\\n我藏着呢。”说着便命丫头们把箱柜一齐打开，将镜奁、妆盒、\\n衾袱、衣包若大若小之物一齐打开，请凤姐去抄阅。凤姐陪笑\\n道：“我不过是奉太太的命来，妹妹别错怪我。何必生气。”\\n因命丫鬟们快快关上。 \\n  平儿丰儿等忙着替待书等关的关，收的收。探春道：“我\\n的东西倒许你们搜阅，要想搜我的丫头，这却不能。我原比众\\n人歹毒，凡丫头所有的东西我都知道，都在我这里间收着，一\\n针一线他们也没的收藏，要搜所以只来搜我。你们不依，只管\\n去回太太，只说我违背了太太，该怎么处治，我去自领。你们\\n别忙，自然连你们抄的日子有呢！你们今日早起不曾议论甄家，\\n自己家里好好的抄家，果然今日真抄了。\",\"text_sha256\":\"139d8b797c42c19fd3ff5e9d961f882631751c60bfaeebe490d77a9da83e392d\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf\",\"chapter\":61,\"classification\":{\"human_review\":\"PENDING\",\"method\":\"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2\",\"reasons\":[\"DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR\"],\"styles\":[{\"color\":2301728,\"font\":\"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H\",\"size\":15.58}]},\"dataset_ref\":\"corpus:front80:v2-candidate\",\"kind\":\"MAIN_TEXT\",\"locator\":{\"extraction_ref\":\"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900\",\"spans\":[{\"end\":795,\"start\":45,\"unit_ref\":\"pdf:page:820\"}],\"transforms\":[]},\"record_type\":\"SEGMENT\",\"section_ref\":\"chapter:61\",\"segment_id\":\"hlm80:chapter:61:p00020\",\"selection_reason\":\"第61回平儿处理失窃案：观察真相、体面与处理办法。\",\"text\":\"恐次日有变，大家先起了个清早，都悄悄的来买转平儿，一面\\n送些东西，一面又奉承他办事简断，一面又讲述他母亲素日许\\n多不好。平儿一一的都应着，打发他们去了，却悄悄的来访袭\\n人，问他可果真芳官给他露了。袭人便说：“露却是给芳官，\\n芳官转给何人我却不知。”袭人于是又问芳官，芳官听了，唬\\n天跳地，忙应是自己送他的。芳官便又告诉了宝玉，宝玉也慌\\n了，说：“露虽有了，若勾起茯苓霜来，他自然也实供。若听\\n见了是他舅舅门上得的，他舅舅又有了不是，岂不是人家的好\\n意，反被咱们陷害了。”因忙和平儿计议：“露的事虽完，然\\n这霜也是有不是的。好姐姐，你叫他说也是芳官给他的就完\\n了。”平儿笑道：“虽如此，只是他昨晚已经同人说是他舅舅\\n给的了，如何又说你给的？况且那边所丢的露也是无主儿，如\\n今有赃证的白放了，又去找谁？谁还肯认？众人也未必心服。”\\n晴雯走来笑道：“太太那边的露再无别人，分明是彩云偷了给\\n环哥儿去了。你们可瞎乱说。”平儿笑道：“谁不知是这个原\\n故，但今玉钏儿急的哭，悄悄问着他，他若应了，玉钏也罢了，\\n大家也就混着不问了。难道我们好意兜揽这事不成！可恨彩云\\n不但不应，他还挤玉钏儿，说他偷了去了。两个人窝里发炮，\\n先吵的合府皆知，我们如何装没事人。少不得要查的。殊不知\\n告失盗的就是贼，又没赃证，怎么说他。” \\n  宝玉道：“也罢，这件事我也应起来，就说是我唬他们顽\\n的，悄悄的偷了太太的来了。两件事都完了。”袭人道：“也\\n倒是件阴骘事，保全人的贼名儿。只是太太听见又说你小孩子\\n气，不知好歹了。”平儿笑道：“这也倒是小事。如今便从赵\\n姨娘屋里起了赃来也容易，我只怕又伤着一个好人的体面。别\\n人都别管，这一个人岂不又生气。我可怜的是他，不肯为了打\\n老鼠伤了玉瓶。”说着，把三个指头一伸。袭人等听说，便知\\n\",\"text_sha256\":\"1f791b115b1d1a5e5b2768f3046b4dfeed1d4a2175fa8d26b04bb1d39095da98\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf\",\"chapter\":52,\"classification\":{\"human_review\":\"PENDING\",\"method\":\"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2\",\"reasons\":[\"DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR\"],\"styles\":[{\"color\":2301728,\"font\":\"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H\",\"size\":15.58}]},\"dataset_ref\":\"corpus:front80:v2-candidate\",\"kind\":\"MAIN_TEXT\",\"locator\":{\"extraction_ref\":\"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900\",\"spans\":[{\"end\":713,\"start\":37,\"unit_ref\":\"pdf:page:709\"}],\"transforms\":[]},\"record_type\":\"SEGMENT\",\"section_ref\":\"chapter:52\",\"segment_id\":\"hlm80:chapter:52:p00052\",\"selection_reason\":\"第52回雀金裘被烧、晴雯病补：观察物质动作推动场面。\",\"text\":\"刚安静了些。只见宝玉回来，进门就嗐声跺脚。麝月忙问原故，\\n宝玉道：“今儿老太太喜喜欢欢的给了这个褂子，谁知不防后\\n襟子上烧了一块，幸而天晚了，老太太、太太都不理论。”一\\n面说，一面脱下来。麝月瞧时，果见有指头大的烧眼，说：“这\\n必定是手炉里的火迸上了。这不值什么，赶着叫人悄悄的拿出\\n去，叫个能干织补匠人织上就是了。”说着便用包袱包了，交\\n与一个妈妈送出去。说：“赶天亮就有才好。千万别给老太太、\\n太太知道。”婆子去了半日，仍旧拿回来，说：“不但能干织\\n补匠人，就连裁缝绣匠并作女工的问了，都不认得这是什么，\\n都不敢揽。”麝月道：“这怎么样呢！明儿不穿也罢了。”宝\\n玉道：“明儿是正日子，老太太、太太说了，还叫穿这个去呢。\\n偏头一日烧了，岂不扫兴。” \\n  晴雯听了半日，忍不住翻身说道：“拿来我瞧瞧罢。没个\\n福气穿就罢了，这会子又着急。”宝玉笑道：“这话倒说的是。”\\n说着，便递与晴雯，又移过灯来，细看了一会。晴雯道：“这\\n是孔雀金线织的，如今咱们也拿孔雀金线就像界线似的界密了，\\n只怕还可混得过去。”麝月笑道：“孔雀线现成的，但这里除\\n了你，还有谁会界线？”晴雯道：“说不得，我挣命罢了。”\\n宝玉忙道：“这如何使得！才好了些，如何做得活。”晴雯道：\\n“不用你蝎蝎螫螫的，我自知道。”一面说，一面坐起来，挽\\n了一挽头发，披了衣裳，只觉头重身轻，满眼金星乱迸，实实\\n掌不住。若不做，又怕宝玉着急，少不得恨命咬牙捱着。便命\\n麝月只帮着拈线。晴雯先拿了一根比一比，笑道：“这虽不很\\n像，若补上，也不很显。”宝玉道：“这就很好，那里又找哦\\n啰嘶国的裁缝去。”\",\"text_sha256\":\"919dfdc9482c1dfa76b40d1ce9ff0cd53ae2738cea6d354fc47d381d3e04c525\"}],\"guidance\":\"Organize scene obligations and check entry/exit constraints before writing.\",\"input_readiness\":{\"blockers\":[\"CORPUS_HUMAN_LAYER_AUDIT_PENDING\"],\"scope\":\"FROZEN_RESEARCH_WRITING_INPUTS\"},\"operation_scope\":\"RESEARCH\",\"package\":{\"assets\":[{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:sha256:23861cce04acb8308e2d9c19a38445cddbe985b41fc8f0458d965e2379309072\",\"sha256\":\"23861cce04acb8308e2d9c19a38445cddbe985b41fc8f0458d965e2379309072\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:sha256:626917a3603d00697ccb86e6be8d1bb5b40911ffad700436ea836cd8e6336261\",\"sha256\":\"626917a3603d00697ccb86e6be8d1bb5b40911ffad700436ea836cd8e6336261\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:sha256:66508dc74b1e09e9b0ad69f0cb781ae881505ee4f446075d85386bfb228205b7\",\"sha256\":\"66508dc74b1e09e9b0ad69f0cb781ae881505ee4f446075d85386bfb228205b7\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:sha256:6ab10932c4f8ae3580ec1f1db3034e8ba2fee58ae038db9556204ee11aeb0d44\",\"sha256\":\"6ab10932c4f8ae3580ec1f1db3034e8ba2fee58ae038db9556204ee11aeb0d44\"},{\"asset_ref\":\"asset:sha256:c1946d9ff097372aa0583eec627a5f37ec77ec3b076fa2229c23f7f441bb7eb0\",\"sha256\":\"c1946d9ff097372aa0583eec627a5f37ec77ec3b076fa2229c23f7f441bb7eb0\"}],\"authority_effect\":\"NONE\",\"chapter\":81,\"exemplar_set\":{\"path\":\"data/writing/exemplars/ch89-research-v3.json\",\"sha256\":\"2989c8f10355a541e3388b5d3aad23e6c96e03ca2ccc6fe2ab9bfe0ab19f6b49\"},\"id\":\"writing-package:ch81:agent-research:v4\",\"operation_scope\":\"RESEARCH\",\"plan\":[{\"path\":\"data/project/plan_constraints_v1.json\",\"sha256\":\"8f3ca1572c57e6440d94eb151680f189994b6c2097a5c02609b55e35a32b94cd\"},{\"path\":\"data/planning/chapters/ch81.json\",\"sha256\":\"2a0cbae8058f6022e842336a99acbfcb8bc703954eb86c4e873a1cbf50251f6c\"},{\"path\":\"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/81-S1.v2.json\",\"sha256\":\"69a661188a11669b716a9c4f301f9fc1048c82c17aff1a728d1a9d52e5c0684f\"},{\"path\":\"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/81-S2.v2.json\",\"sha256\":\"671efeff98dff5cfe22e9fb12fdc05cae44ff4ce416cde9d35dd2c927947228b\"},{\"path\":\"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/81-S3.v2.json\",\"sha256\":\"16cc416444f2c9f1dbd28a0188700671dc466dbe27aceb3918d9197937a1beb2\"}],\"purpose\":\"第81回全书会话研究试写：显式选择经模型编辑的场景合同版本。未知状态仍未验收，史料/语料/文学资格未授予；不修改稳定版。\",\"schema_version\":1,\"sources\":[],\"world\":[{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_body.json\",\"sha256\":\"429ca248ea42aa0601e11a55d40fa446da92cee48936627a83b335ab9b18056e\"},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_core.json\",\"sha256\":\"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733\"},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_knowledge.json\",\"sha256\":\"d8ee374ec667317af6ef304dc4b66ad7d3ceae9f20753c1b35cf029c73dee18b\"},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_locations.json\",\"sha256\":\"ed1a4053f1459193777f486b3a9743c5aec28afb7d027dee12684da6e3a9d81b\"},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_presence.json\",\"sha256\":\"7880480b001c321e50056e887f1285f6c7ccf975aed140d1515967ea925bb3bb\"},{\"path\":\"data/world/m3_resources.json\",\"sha256\":\"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668\"}]},\"plan\":{\"data/planning/chapters/ch81.json\":{\"authority_effect\":\"NONE\",\"card_fields\":[{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4174,4390],\"lines\":[111,113],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"b6b8679c7fb2ec2253cea1f80a4236fa4276d15fe39299b90bb87bd6bc7c846d\"},\"name\":\"现有硬节点\",\"number\":1,\"text\":\"**1｜现有硬节点**  \\nR36“香魂返故乡”强约束；第80香菱已有血分亏损、干血病史，81只能承接，不得另造新病。当前死亡回次属C级施工，不把具体死法反升硬证。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4390,4577],\"lines\":[114,116],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f0879c9ca2829acf13a4d6803a04c8a7ba938d4250c61c309de7be8b82b901b7\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最强处\",\"number\":2,\"text\":\"**2｜当前正文最强处**  \\n莺儿抢针线、甜羹银匙、淡青袖口未缝完；宝钗把旧诗稿夹入匣中；最终“并没人再念一遍”。这是本回最高P-Lock。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4577,4776],\"lines\":[117,119],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"27c6a142b564a9acd734196fe15be392177c7e2290430abc7d111cc668fbe3a5\"},\"name\":\"当前正文最薄处\",\"number\":3,\"text\":\"**3｜当前正文最薄处**  \\n病程从“已经坏下去”到死亡的家庭判断过程仍略快；谁决定换不换医生、谁开始预备后事、薛家如何分担费用可再实一层。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4776,4957],\"lines\":[120,122],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"a13f7d23002b036937d0acdcdc8bcc5cce743b37083f8054a98e45d057a5fbde\"},\"name\":\"缺失情节\",\"number\":4,\"text\":\"**4｜缺失情节**  \\n补81-S1小争执：是否换医；81-S2病危后先备什么；81-S3死后第一轮谁料理、谁守、谁报信。只补过程，不加第二场危机。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[4957,5106],\"lines\":[123,125],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"2b9586da6ba1c5848634b2f92bcce0d00397aa3b91c2a227aef055688b317c4c\"},\"name\":\"缺失人物\",\"number\":5,\"text\":\"**5｜缺失人物**  \\n药铺跑腿、旧大夫/替换大夫可一闪而过；薛姨妈、宝钗、莺儿权责要清。不得新造“名医”。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5106,5194],\"lines\":[126,128],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"e714852c80abf0969e357bcb0571759ada6cada4611dd65fec130f7a928682cc\"},\"name\":\"缺失文化门类\",\"number\":6,\"text\":\"**6｜缺失文化门类**  \\n不补琴棋书画。香菱唯一文化主轴是诗稿。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5194,5400],\"lines\":[129,131],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"75205d4f3524473192ddf886335faa979e8db919fa738b8db63e3e1455ea152b\"},\"name\":\"诗文身份\",\"number\":7,\"text\":\"**7｜诗文身份**  \\nG02唯一开放：可在三张旧月诗之外夹一张**病前未成旧稿**，最多一两句；第45三案竞选。不得临终口占、绝命诗。作者回前/回末诗：无。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5400,5534],\"lines\":[132,134],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"abc7114b6235f49d80259c7b5007dbf662d5e06f1b0d7335b4f7f496d7e48e8c\"},\"name\":\"笑料/俗文化\",\"number\":8,\"text\":\"**8｜笑料/俗文化**  \\n保留“药苦是不是莺儿煎久了”等轻口角，让病回仍有人味；不新增临终笑料。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5534,5650],\"lines\":[135,137],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"589fddb1c50bf47a5f899b6e0e855604ad48847f520f0b4c908fc81fe81741c4\"},\"name\":\"梦/宗教\",\"number\":9,\"text\":\"**9｜梦/宗教**  \\n低强度。人物可说“命苦”等俗语，不做香菱梦归故乡、托梦、悟道。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5650,5794],\"lines\":[138,140],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"389c8ad25226231e7e1f32902e9727ed2a4baf79c2f398b381656e9e73bb66e5\"},\"name\":\"职业人物\",\"number\":10,\"text\":\"**10｜职业人物**  \\n大夫、药铺伙计只承担真实医药链；后事可有普通买棺/白布接口，但不要展开行业展示。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[5794,6024],\"lines\":[141,143],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"c25ae2da466fd1bb06d1f27066219d885d8188bb098617b4905f0e88fd1cb22d\"},\"name\":\"人钱物信四链\",\"number\":11,\"text\":\"**11｜人钱物信四链**  \\n人：薛姨妈—宝钗—莺儿—医者。钱：仍属E0，薛家有钱但不是无限。物：药、米汤、甜羹、寿衣/白布、诗稿。信：病危先在内宅，死后再分头报人。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6024,6113],\"lines\":[144,146],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"15aa16c8737f925efc18b5cf931fa8df6c839e745041936244018df0589aad62\"},\"name\":\"必须保留\",\"number\":12,\"text\":\"**12｜必须保留**  \\n淡青袖口、银匙、甜羹、诗稿合匣、无人重读。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6113,6233],\"lines\":[147,149],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"44868fa023026893e476840b3e9d860421adf22f498b597e35b5512801855557\"},\"name\":\"应删/应降\",\"number\":13,\"text\":\"**13｜应删/应降**  \\n任何把香菱一生概括成“诗成而命尽”的作者说明；任何新咳血奇观。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6233,6272],\"lines\":[150,152],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f139bd53eab5c715ba42c69c45afb23b68241f0f05ce11a5075a301f8b5cb4d2\"},\"name\":\"L3候选\",\"number\":14,\"text\":\"**14｜L3候选**  \\n无。最高L2。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6272,6438],\"lines\":[153,155],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"f27e6fc231316cf9ef8b8d71fcc7ed74cff0c73ecaa5829600f71745f936d734\"},\"name\":\"前80同构\",\"number\":15,\"text\":\"**15｜前80同构**  \\n48—49香菱学诗的“用力、改稿、梦中得句”与本回旧稿形成回声；63“死金丹”提示死亡回仍可并存家务。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6438,6467],\"lines\":[156,158],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"62839ce573b6e44b7587da02b72bc758ff77474e45becd4e4e057625041775cd\"},\"name\":\"回前诗\",\"number\":16,\"text\":\"**16｜回前诗**  \\n无。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6467,6547],\"lines\":[159,161],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"3850fe112671cba7c2411df7e6d44677ffe2b792011cd04fe0dfd4ae3e75bbdb\"},\"name\":\"回末诗\",\"number\":17,\"text\":\"**17｜回末诗**  \\n无；“没人再念一遍”必须胜过作者挽诗。\\n\\n\"},{\"citation\":{\"byte_range\":[6547,6830],\"lines\":[162,165],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"4fc2d6eb3d26982bacc72a3385e0066eb197112b17d8b57d417640929e63e596\"},\"name\":\"最终章法 / 风险\",\"number\":18,\"text\":\"**18｜最终章法 / 风险**  \\n病日常 → 是否换医的小争执 → 短暂好转/饮食 → 病危 → 女眷处理身体 → 报信与后事 → 诗稿/袖口归置 → 无人再念。  \\n**风险：**把香菱写成第二黛玉；把“诗命”写成临终才华展览。\\n\\n\"}],\"chapter\":81,\"entry_ref\":null,\"evidence_effect\":\"NONE\",\"existing_contracts\":[],\"exit_ref\":null,\"open_refs\":[],\"order_basis\":\"SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY\",\"protections\":[\"data/implementation_alignment/m6.json#/chapter_protections/0\"],\"scenes\":[{\"id\":\"81-S1\",\"order\":1,\"ref\":\"data/planning/scenes/81-S1.json\"},{\"id\":\"81-S2\",\"order\":2,\"ref\":\"data/planning/scenes/81-S2.json\"},{\"id\":\"81-S3\",\"order\":3,\"ref\":\"data/planning/scenes/81-S3.json\"}],\"source\":{\"byte_range\":[4054,6835],\"lines\":[106,167],\"path\":\"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md\",\"sha256\":\"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c\",\"text_sha256\":\"fbd00bbe7949123cb3f7304182d15913f176f2f933f44f891f6faf8f021420ba\"},\"source_records\":[{\"path\":\"data/reconstruction/m2.json\",\"pointer\":\"/chapters/0\",\"ref\":\"data/reconstruction/m2.json#/chapters/0\",\"sha256\":\"345b9572314ef414c1b4b4892126a57a89b335bdb0a756fa9d2e89a909d6939f\",\"text_sha256\":\"53ec029f504abefdc43900a49f65f4995702b90c4643665990da377c2fe8f17b\",\"value\":{\"anchor_refs\":[\"R36\"],\"chapter\":81,\"field_schema_ref\":\"chapter-card-18-fields-v2.5\",\"key_constraints\